			"Message": "fix(Rest): Replace em dashes with hyphens in Mermaid diagram labels\n\nMermaid rendering engines are inconsistent with Unicode em dashes (U+2014) inside quoted subgraph and node labels across platforms (GitHub, VS Code Markdown preview, documentation tooling). Replace all five em dashes in the system architecture diagram with simple hyphens to guarantee consistent rendering regardless of viewer environment.\n\nAffected labels: Rest subgraph title, Compilation Pipeline subgraph title, Build and Bundle mode labels, and Output subgraph title.",
